<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <template id="report_fleet_spk_document">
        <t t-call="web.html_container">
            <t t-foreach="docs" t-as="o">
                <t t-call="web.basic_layout">
                    <div class="page" style="font-size: 12px; position: relative;">
                        <!-- Watermark status. -webkit-transform wajib: wkhtmltopdf pakai WebKit lama. -->
                        <div t-if="o.state in ('new', 'waiting_approval')"
                             style="position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 0; width: 100%; text-align: center;
                                    transform: rotate(-45deg); -webkit-transform: rotate(-45deg);
                                    font-size: 110px; font-weight: bold; color: #808080; opacity: 0.22;
                                    z-index: 1000; letter-spacing: 12px;">DRAFT</div>
                        <div t-if="o.state == 'rejected'"
                             style="position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 0; width: 100%; text-align: center;
                                    transform: rotate(-45deg); -webkit-transform: rotate(-45deg);
                                    font-size: 100px; font-weight: bold; color: #cc0000; opacity: 0.22;
                                    z-index: 1000; letter-spacing: 8px;">REJECTED</div>

                        <t t-set="service_line_recs" t-value="o.product_line_ids.filtered('is_service_line')"/>
                        <t t-set="spare_line_recs" t-value="o.product_line_ids - service_line_recs"/>
                        <t t-set="service_total" t-value="sum(service_line_recs.mapped('subtotal'))"/>
                        <t t-set="sparepart_total" t-value="sum(spare_line_recs.mapped('subtotal'))"/>
                        <t t-set="grand_total" t-value="o.total_amount"/>
                        <t t-set="num_sections" t-value="(1 if service_line_recs else 0) + (1 if spare_line_recs else 0)"/>

                        <div style="text-align: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 8px;">
                            SURAT PERINTAH KERJA (SPK)
                        </div>
                        <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 8px;">
                            <tr>
                                <td style="width: 65%; vertical-align: top;">
                                    <img t-if="o.env.company.logo" t-att-src="image_data_uri(o.env.company.logo)" style="max-height: 45px; margin-bottom: 8px;" alt="Logo"/>
                                    <div><strong><span t-esc="o.env.company.partner_id.name or ''"/></strong></div>
                                    <div><span t-esc="o.env.company.partner_id.contact_address or ''"/></div>
                                    <div>Telp. <span t-esc="o.env.company.partner_id.phone or '-'"/></div>
                                </td>
                                <td style="width: 35%; vertical-align: top;">
                                    <div><strong>Tanggal SPK</strong> : <span t-field="o.spk_date"/></div>
                                    <div><strong>No SPK</strong> : <span t-field="o.name"/></div>
                                    <div><strong>Rencana Masuk Bengkel</strong> : <span t-field="o.planning_date"/></div>
                                    <div><strong>Estimasi Selesai</strong> : <span t-field="o.finish_date_estimation"/></div>
                                    <div t-if="o.actual_finish_date"><strong>Tanggal Selesai</strong> : <span t-field="o.actual_finish_date"/></div>
                                    <div><strong>JENIS SPK</strong> : <span t-esc="dict(o._fields['category'].selection).get(o.category, '')"/></div>
                                    <div><strong>Type Perbaikan</strong> : <span t-field="o.maintenance_type_id"/></div>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid #555; margin-bottom: 8px;">
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding: 4px;">
                                    <strong>Kepada Yth.</strong><br/>
                                    Nama Bengkel : <span t-field="o.vendor_id"/><br/>
                                    Alamat : <span t-esc="o.vendor_id.contact_address or '-'"/><br/>
                                    Telp : <span t-esc="o.vendor_id.phone or '-'"/> &#160;&#160;&#160; PIC : <span t-esc="o.pic_client or '-'"/>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid #555; margin-bottom: 8px;">
                            <tr>
                                <th colspan="4" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #555; padding: 4px; text-align: center;">DATA KENDARAAN</th>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding: 3px; width: 17%;"><strong>No Polisi</strong></td>
                                <td style="padding: 3px; width: 33%;"><span t-field="o.license_plate"/></td>
                                <td style="padding: 3px; width: 17%;"><strong>Tahun Kendaraan</strong></td>
                                <td style="padding: 3px; width: 33%;"><span t-field="o.year"/></td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding: 3px;"><strong>Merk</strong></td>
                                <td style="padding: 3px;"><span t-esc="o.vehicle_id.model_id.brand_id.name if o.vehicle_id.model_id and o.vehicle_id.model_id.brand_id else '-'"/></td>
                                <td style="padding: 3px;"><strong>Warna</strong></td>
                                <td style="padding: 3px;"><span t-field="o.color"/></td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding: 3px;"><strong>Type Kendaraan</strong></td>
                                <td style="padding: 3px;"><span t-esc="o.vehicle_id.model_id.display_name if o.vehicle_id.model_id else '-'"/></td>
                                <td style="padding: 3px;"><strong>No Rangka</strong></td>
                                <td style="padding: 3px;"><span t-field="o.vin_sn"/></td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding: 3px;"><strong>Klien</strong></td>
                                <td style="padding: 3px;"><span t-field="o.customer_id"/></td>
                                <td style="padding: 3px;"><strong>No Mesin</strong></td>
                                <td style="padding: 3px;"><span t-field="o.engine_number"/></td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding: 3px;"><strong>Nama PIC/User</strong></td>
                                <td style="padding: 3px;"><span t-esc="o.pic_client or '-'"/></td>
                                <td style="padding: 3px;"><strong>Odometer (KM)</strong></td>
                                <td style="padding: 3px;"><span t-field="o.odometer"/></td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding: 3px;"><strong>No HP PIC Client</strong></td>
                                <td style="padding: 3px;"><span t-esc="o.pic_client_phone or '-'"/></td>
                                <td style="padding: 3px;"></td>
                                <td style="padding: 3px;"></td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid #555; margin-bottom: 8px;">
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding: 4px; border-bottom: 1px solid #555;">
                                    <strong>Keluhan / Komplain</strong> :
                                    <span t-esc="o.description or '-'"/>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding: 4px;">
                                    <strong>Pekerjaan</strong> :
                                    <span t-esc="o.description or '-'"/>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <table t-if="service_line_recs" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid black; margin-bottom: 8px;">
                            <thead>
                                <tr>
                                    <th colspan="5" style="text-align: left; border: 1px solid black; padding: 4px;">
                                        <t t-if="o.maintenance_is_on_risk">Jasa / Service (Own Risk)</t>
                                        <t t-else="">Jasa / Service</t>
                                    </th>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <th style="padding: 3px; border: 1px solid black; width: 5%;">No</th>
                                    <th style="padding: 3px; border: 1px solid black; width: 30%;">Nama Jasa Pekerjaan</th>
                                    <th style="padding: 3px; border: 1px solid black; width: 30%;">Kategori Pekerjaan</th>
                                    <th style="padding: 3px; border: 1px solid black; width: 10%; text-align: right;">Total Biaya</th>
                                    <th style="padding: 3px; border: 1px solid black; width: 20%; text-align: right;">Subtotal</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody>
                                <tr t-foreach="service_line_recs" t-as="line">
                                    <td style="padding: 3px; border: 1px solid black;"><span t-esc="line_index + 1"/></td>
                                    <td style="padding: 3px; border: 1px solid black;"><span t-field="line.product_id"/></td>
                                    <td style="padding: 3px; border: 1px solid black;"><span t-esc="line.product_id.kategori_pekerjaan_id.name if line.product_id.kategori_pekerjaan_id else '-'"/></td>
                                    <td style="padding: 3px; border: 1px solid black; text-align: right;">
                                        <span t-field="line.unit_price" t-options="{'widget': 'monetary', 'display_currency': o.currency_id}"/>
                                    </td>
                                    <td style="padding: 3px; border: 1px solid black; text-align: right;">
                                        <span t-field="line.subtotal" t-options="{'widget': 'monetary', 'display_currency': o.currency_id}"/>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td colspan="4" style="padding: 3px; border: 1px solid black; text-align: right;">
                                        <strong t-if="o.maintenance_is_on_risk">Total Jasa (Own Risk)</strong>
                                        <t t-else=""><strong>Total Jasa</strong></t>
                                    </td>
                                    <td style="padding: 3px; border: 1px solid black; text-align: right;">
                                        <strong><span t-esc="service_total" t-options="{'widget': 'monetary', 'display_currency': o.currency_id}"/></strong>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>

                        <table t-if="spare_line_recs" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid black; margin-bottom: 8px;">
                            <thead>
                                <tr>
                                    <th colspan="8" style="text-align: left; border: 1px solid black; padding: 4px;">
                                        <t t-if="o.maintenance_is_on_risk">Sparepart Own Risk (Kecelakaan)</t>
                                        <t t-else="">Sparepart</t>
                                    </th>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <th style="padding: 3px; border: 1px solid black; width: 5%;">No</th>
                                    <th style="padding: 3px; border: 1px solid black; width: 18%;">Kode Spare Part</th>
                                    <th style="padding: 3px; border: 1px solid black; width: 15%;">Kategori Spare Part</th>
                                    <th style="padding: 3px; border: 1px solid black; width: 20%;">Nama Spare Part</th>
                                    <th style="padding: 3px; border: 1px solid black; width: 8%; text-align: right;">Qty</th>
                                    <th style="padding: 3px; border: 1px solid black; width: 8%;">UoM</th>
                                    <th style="padding: 3px; border: 1px solid black; width: 10%; text-align: right;">Harga Satuan</th>
                                    <th style="padding: 3px; border: 1px solid black; width: 16%; text-align: right;">Subtotal</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody>
                                <tr t-foreach="spare_line_recs" t-as="line">
                                    <td style="padding: 3px; border: 1px solid black;"><span t-esc="line_index + 1"/></td>
                                    <td style="padding: 3px; border: 1px solid black;"><span t-esc="line.product_id.kode_sparepart or '-'"/></td>
                                    <td style="padding: 3px; border: 1px solid black;"><span t-esc="line.product_id.kategori_sparepart_id.name if line.product_id.kategori_sparepart_id else '-'"/></td>
                                    <td style="padding: 3px; border: 1px solid black;"><span t-field="line.product_id"/></td>
                                    <td style="padding: 3px; border: 1px solid black; text-align: right;"><span t-field="line.quantity"/></td>
                                    <td style="padding: 3px; border: 1px solid black;"><span t-field="line.product_uom_id"/></td>
                                    <td style="padding: 3px; border: 1px solid black; text-align: right;">
                                        <span t-field="line.unit_price" t-options="{'widget': 'monetary', 'display_currency': o.currency_id}"/>
                                    </td>
                                    <td style="padding: 3px; border: 1px solid black; text-align: right;">
                                        <span t-field="line.subtotal" t-options="{'widget': 'monetary', 'display_currency': o.currency_id}"/>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td colspan="7" style="padding: 3px; border: 1px solid black; text-align: right;">
                                        <strong t-if="o.maintenance_is_on_risk">Total Sparepart Own Risk</strong>
                                        <t t-else=""><strong>Total Sparepart</strong></t>
                                    </td>
                                    <td style="padding: 3px; border: 1px solid black; text-align: right;">
                                        <strong><span t-esc="sparepart_total" t-options="{'widget': 'monetary', 'display_currency': o.currency_id}"/></strong>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>

                        <table t-if="num_sections &gt; 1" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid #555; margin-bottom: 8px;">
                            <tbody>
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="padding: 6px; text-align: right;"><strong>Grand Total</strong></td>
                                    <td style="padding: 6px; width: 25%; text-align: right;">
                                        <strong><span t-esc="grand_total" t-options="{'widget': 'monetary', 'display_currency': o.currency_id}"/></strong>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>

                        <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid #555; margin-bottom: 8px;">
                            <tr>
                                <td style="width: 33%; padding: 4px; vertical-align: top;">
                                    <strong>Created by,</strong><br/><br/><br/>
                                    Nama : ____________________
                                </td>
                                <td style="width: 33%; padding: 4px; vertical-align: top;">
                                    <strong>Approved by,</strong><br/>
                                    <t t-set="final_approval"
                                       t-value="o.approval_tracking_ids.filtered(lambda t: t.state == 'approved').sorted(key=lambda t: (t.sequence, t.id))[-1:]"/>
                                    <t t-if="o.state in ('approved', 'done', 'received', 'close') and final_approval">
                                        <div style="display: inline-block; border: 2px solid #1a7f37; color: #1a7f37;
                                                    border-radius: 4px; padding: 2px 6px; font-size: 10px;
                                                    font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase;
                                                    transform: rotate(-6deg); -webkit-transform: rotate(-6deg);
                                                    margin: 2px 0 4px 0;">Digitally Approved</div><br/>
                                        Nama : <span t-field="final_approval.approver_id"/><br/>
                                        Tanggal : <span t-field="final_approval.date" t-options="{'widget': 'date'}"/>
                                    </t>
                                    <t t-else="">
                                        <br/><br/>
                                        Nama : ____________________
                                    </t>
                                </td>
                                <td style="width: 34%; padding: 4px; vertical-align: top;">
                                    <strong>Vendor,</strong><br/><br/>
                                    <span t-field="o.vendor_id"/><br/>
                                    PIC : ____________________
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <div style="border: 1px solid #555; padding: 6px; font-size: 11px;">
                            <strong>Catatan :</strong>
                            <ol style="margin: 4px 0 0 16px; padding: 0;">
                                <li>Setiap pekerjaan bengkel harus sesuai Surat Perintah Kerja (SPK), jika ada tambahan baru (jasa atau sparepart) harus konfirmasi ke PIC.</li>
                                <li>Setiap SPK yang menjadi lampiran tagihan wajib distempel dan ditandatangani pihak pelanggan dan pihak bengkel.</li>
                                <li>Untuk penggantian ban/aki, wajib mencantumkan nomor seri lama dan baru.</li>
                                <li>Pihak perusahaan berhak menolak pembayaran jika pekerjaan service tidak sesuai dengan SPK.</li>
                                <li>Setiap tagihan harus ditujukan atas nama perusahaan berikut dokumen pendukung.</li>
                            </ol>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </t>
            </t>
        </t>
    </template>

    <record id="paperformat_spk_report" model="report.paperformat">
        <field name="name">SPK Paperformat</field>
        <field name="default" eval="False"/>
        <field name="format">A4</field>
        <field name="orientation">Portrait</field>
        <field name="margin_top">10</field>
        <field name="margin_bottom">10</field>
        <field name="margin_left">10</field>
        <field name="margin_right">10</field>
        <field name="header_line" eval="False"/>
        <field name="header_spacing">0</field>
        <field name="dpi">90</field>
    </record>

    <record id="action_report_fleet_spk" model="ir.actions.report">
        <field name="name">SPK Print Out</field>
        <field name="model">fleet.spk</field>
        <field name="report_type">qweb-pdf</field>
        <field name="report_name">x_spk.report_fleet_spk_document</field>
        <field name="report_file">x_spk.report_fleet_spk_document</field>
        <field name="print_report_name">'SPK - %s' % (object.name or '')</field>
        <field name="binding_model_id" ref="model_fleet_spk"/>
        <field name="binding_type">report</field>
        <field name="paperformat_id" ref="x_spk.paperformat_spk_report"/>
    </record>
</odoo>
